HB0277 Capitol complex-hotel and conference center.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman, Nicholas and Wylie and
Senator(s) Anderson
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; authorizing a public-
private partnership for a construction project as specified; specifying
parameters of the project; providing definitions; requiring reports;
authorizing the investment of funds; providing legislative intent; making
conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
